02:38.467 --> 02:40.128
Hold the line

02:43.117 --> 02:49.966
Find the light in the

02:50.367 --> 02:51.569
empty space

03:23.231 --> 03:31.456
Concrete angels in the midnight rain Riding out

03:31.476 --> 03:40.661
